@@ -794,7 +794,7 @@ person.parse({
 // => { name: "bob dylan" }
 ```

-> Using `.catchall()` overrides `.stripUnknown()` or `.strict()`. All keys are now considered "known".
+> Using `.catchall()` overrides `.passsthrough()`, `.strip()`, or `.strict()`. All keys are now considered "known".

